stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Anonymous

  Anonymous --> Authenticating: login(actorId)
  Authenticating --> Authenticated: credentials accepted / persist accessToken + refreshToken
  Authenticating --> Anonymous: login rejected / keep session empty

  Authenticated --> Requesting: request with accessToken
  Requesting --> Authenticated: 2xx/3xx response
  Requesting --> RefreshPending: 401 and no refresh in flight / start shared refresh
  Requesting --> RefreshPending: 401 and refresh in flight / wait existing refresh

  RefreshPending --> Authenticated: refresh succeeds / persist new accessToken and retry queued requests once
  RefreshPending --> Anonymous: refresh fails, stale generation, or refresh returns 401 / clear tokens and user state

  Authenticated --> Anonymous: logout / clear persisted tokens
  RefreshPending --> Anonymous: logout while refresh pending / cancel local session and clear tokens

  note right of Authenticated
    CampusOps profiles:
    reportante creates and views own incidents.
    tecnico resolves assigned incidents.
    coordinador closes or reopens incidents.
    UI visibility never replaces authorization checks.
  end note

  note right of RefreshPending
    coordinateRefresh uses single-flight behavior:
    the first 401 starts refresh, concurrent 401 requests
    share the same refresh, and every original request
    is retried at most once with the new generation.
  end note
